==Battleground==
*Infinite [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*5 [[B.B.Bunny|B.B.Bunnies]] spawn after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>, delay 5.33 seconds<sup>160f</sup>.
*1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>.
*2 [[Le'boin]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 66.67 seconds<sup>2,000f</sup>.
*1 [[The 9th Angel (Enemy)|The 9th Angel]] spawns as the boss after 13.33 seconds<sup>400f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Shadow Boxer K]] spawns.

==Strategy==
This stage relies on fast melee units that can get within The 9th Angel's 200 range blindspot, such as [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed Giraffe]], [[Express Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Maglev]], [[Crazed Titan Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Crazed M. Titan]] and [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut]], provided if the nasty Le'boins are removed before they cause too much trouble. You can also use Uber Rares like [[Sanada Yukimura (Uber Rare Cat)|Yukimura]], [[Kai (Uber Rare Cat)|Divine Kai μ]] and [[Lesser Demon Cat (Uber Rare Cat)|Greater Balrog Cat]] if you have one of them.

